Title: Items not displayed correctly according to rank 

Environment: 
Windows 11 Pro 
Chrome, Version 152.0.7977.83 (Official Build) (64-bit)
Microsoft Edge Version 153.0.4234.32 (Official build) (64-bit)

Severity: Low

Priority: Medium

Preconditions: None/Initial state of website 

Steps to reproduce:
1.	Go to https://buggy.justtestit.org
2.	Click on Overall Rating (https://buggy.justtestit.org/overall)
3.	Click on Rank

Expected result: User should be able to toggle rank order by clicking the Rank button. In the initial state, rank is displayed in sequential order from first to last. Clicking it should display ranks from last to first and clicking it again should again display it as first to last. 

Actual result: Rank is displayed in the order of first and then skips to 10th and counts up from there. Clicking on it again does nothing.

